after vk_find_struct_const() that 6dfa32a does not have and that no patch of
0001-0013 puts there, so the file as published failed `git apply --check` on
its own base tree. Corrected 19.11.2026 by dropping that line; the hunk
counts are -552,7 +552,33 now and the added and removed lines are untouched.
